@* The framework's error banner, hidden until Blazor shows it. One component so every layout gets both the markup and
   its styles (BlazorErrorUi.razor.css); the picker once copied the markup without the style and showed it on every visit. *@
<div id="blazor-error-ui" data-nosnippet>
    An unhandled error has occurred.
    <a href="." class="reload">Reload</a>
    <span class="dismiss">🗙</span>
</div>
